{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/58GmGmIYWQ60SMcG32sBjg?scene=1&click_id=34","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:12.542801+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/58GmGmIYWQ60SMcG32sBjg?scene=1&click_id=34","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9wicia65MbBcYQWuKy9tgVuftKwejKV0g7BQActnyCJcBCK4iaFaRl5Sth0YYBqbtUeqNZWC0PBgYyyXIIJm7O3nA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>为做好2026年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生（含直博生，以下简称推免生）工作，我校已开通推免生报名系统，热忱欢迎广大推免生申请。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/9wicia65MbBcYQWuKy9tgVuftKwejKV0g7VbicrxD2bu5HcSPf5cJIOvzxG3icvxmrTGiaaQcZPWeyt67ficEurccDxA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9wicia65MbBcYQWuKy9tgVuftKwejKV0g7wunm1m6pwPsFokfmP5Dm6h5YIjhW7KgZRktK9SBXzicBiamic3YiaoKzeQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9wicia65MbBcYQWuKy9tgVuftKwejKV0g78xnWxzx1VNks4GKiat0gaiadVJVK4mTlvQicdwN6siaHmwuF2ic4EicpwZWQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>我院接收报考专业有：环境科学、环境工程、环境工程（专业学位）、环境科学与工程（直博生）。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9wicia65MbBcYQWuKy9tgVuftKwejKV0g7wunm1m6pwPsFokfmP5Dm6h5YIjhW7KgZRktK9SBXzicBiamic3YiaoKzeQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9wicia65MbBcYQWuKy9tgVuftKwejKV0g78xnWxzx1VNks4GKiat0gaiadVJVK4mTlvQicdwN6siaHmwuF2ic4EicpwZWQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1．纳入国家普通本科招生计划录取的应届毕业生，获得所在学校的推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span>2．具备以下条件之一者，同等条件下优先接收：</span></p><p><span>（1）在国内外公开出版刊物上发表过与申报专业相关的具有一定水平的学术论文者（排名第一）。</span></p><p><span>（2）本科期间省级及以上个人奖项获得者或集体奖项的主要完成者。</span></p><p><span>3．直博生接收条件：本科期间学习成绩优秀，专业排名名列前茅，具有优秀研究生潜质，申请我院学术型硕士推免生，通过推免生接收考核后，可在教育部推免系统中填报直博生。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9wicia65MbBcYQWuKy9tgVuftKwejKV0g78xnWxzx1VNks4GKiat0gaiadVJVK4mTlvQicdwN6siaHmwuF2ic4EicpwZWQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>支持政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1．享受最高等级学业奖学金。推免生报到入学后，第一学年可直接享受硕士研究生最高等级学业奖学金；直博生报到入学后，第一学年可直接享受博士研究生最高等级学业奖学金。</span></p><p><span>2．优先选择导师。我院推免生新生入学后享有优先选择导师权。</span></p><p><span>3．补贴考试费用。参加我院复试的推免生免缴考试费。</span></p><p><span>4．本校推免生录取后可进入本硕贯通培养，大学四年级提前进入硕士阶段学习，并有资格在硕士一年级通过硕博连读选拔录取为博士研究生。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9wicia65MbBcYQWuKy9tgVuftKwejKV0g7wunm1m6pwPsFokfmP5Dm6h5YIjhW7KgZRktK9SBXzicBiamic3YiaoKzeQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9wicia65MbBcYQWuKy9tgVuftKwejKV0g78xnWxzx1VNks4GKiat0gaiadVJVK4mTlvQicdwN6siaHmwuF2ic4EicpwZWQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.报名时间安排</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>报名起始时间：8月5日，截止时间：9月25日（暂定），请符合报名条件的考生登录我校推免申请系统：</span></p><p><span><span>https://yz.njnu.edu.cn/login/sstm/login.jsp，进行报名。</span></span></p><p><span>2．凡通过本报名系统进行报名，申请我院2026年推免生且符合接收条件的学生，我院将优先安排复试、优先接收。</span></p><p><span>3．应届本科毕业生在推免生申请系统中填报我院硕士研究生，可同时申请我校“国优计划”专项。有关“国优计划”专项研究生的相关情况见我校后续通知。</span></p><p><span>4．通过本系统报名并取得推免生资格的学生，待教育部开通推免生报名系统后（预计9月28日），仍须在教育部的推免系统中完成填报志愿等相关操作，否则申请无效。教育部推免系统开放后，申请者应根据我院的要求在规定时间内完成报名、接受复试通知、接受待录取通知等操作。我院将根据复试成绩择优录取，录满为止。</span></p><p><span>5．我院将根据教育部最新推免生政策，及时公布2026年接收推免生的最新信息，请及时关注我校研究生招生网和环境学院官网相关信息。</span></p><p><span>6．推免生考试工作由我院负责组织，请申请者关注环境学院官网通知并保持联系方式畅通。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9wicia65MbBcYQWuKy9tgVuftKwejKV0g78xnWxzx1VNks4GKiat0gaiadVJVK4mTlvQicdwN6siaHmwuF2ic4EicpwZWQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>“环”聚英才，“境”待花开。点击下方链接，一图看懂南京师范大学环境学院。https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/S1QepZFLjWS-lHhEpOmsMA</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>图：南京师范大学环境学院</span></p><p><span>文：南京师范大学环境学院</span></p><p><span>编：任秋瑗</span></p><p><span>审：何欢 韩雪</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/9wicia65MbBcYQWuKy9tgVuftKwejKV0g7GJbhQAtAsP5w7icJiaxgmVmFbpjlqayxG6IlpBZC7XHlwCTMhTYUsibpg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"6136d99efc79fd8729035266877d2affccbd913e143952a21b06118dcbc1cbfe","textLength":1141,"sourceSha256":"a0db20caee2e307ed5b257cea1c4172de2c56c2f7d53f9b2671057a14d30eb00","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-88d7202d249e42d78779","title":"2025年南京师范大学环境学院2026年推免生接收报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:12.542801+00:00"}
